# Routing rules that ship with the published folder.
#
# The first matching rule wins, so the API rules MUST stay above the
# single-page fallback. If the fallback ran first, /api/* would be answered
# with index.html and the app would report
# "the server returned a web page instead of data".

/api/ping     /.netlify/functions/ping          200!
/api/*        /.netlify/functions/api/:splat    200!

# Single-page fallback for direct links to app pages. Must stay last.
/*            /index.html                       200
